  "prefLabel": "He-P 4070.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4070.02 Scope. Except as otherwise specifically provided, the rules in this part shall apply to any person who is an applicant for, or a holder of:\n\n(a) A radioactive material license or a general licensed device registration issued pursuant to He-P 4030, He‑P 4031, He-P 4032, He-P 4033, He-P 4034, He-P 4035, He-P 4036, He-P 4037, or He-P 4039; or\n\n(b) A certificate of registration for radiation or MRI machines issued pursuant to He-P 4040.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4062-4097.html"
}
